  "description": "BarcodeLib.com WinForms QR Code Generator Library\n\nWinForms QR Code Generator Library is a C# barcode library to create QR Code symbology in Windows Forms desktop apps. You can easily generate QR Code images in the Visual Studio .NET Windows projects.\n\n\nQuick to start C# code\n==============================\nusing BarcodeLib.Barcode;\n\n// Create a QR Code barcode\nQRCode qrcode = new QRCode();\nqrcode.Data = \"https://www.barcodelib.com\";\nqrcode.drawBarcode(\"C://output//qrcode.png\");\n\n\n\nDocuments\n==============================\n- WinForms Barcode Generator Library : https://www.barcodelib.com/net_winforms/main.html\n- WinForms Barcode Generator Tutorial : https://www.barcodelib.com/net_winforms/barcode_symbologies.html\n- How to Create QR Code in WinForms : https://www.barcodelib.com/net_winforms/barcode_symbologies/qrcode.html\n- Email : support@barcodelib.com",
